@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

autonumber

actor "Editor" as Editor
participant "System" as System

activate Editor

    Editor -> System : asks to create a map
    activate System

        System --> Editor : receives the request and asks for a size
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : types a size
    activate System

        System --> Editor : receives the size and asks for a name, \n displays the data and asks for confirmation
    deactivate System

    Editor -> System : types a name
    activate System

    System --> Editor : receives the name and displays the data for confirmation
            deactivate System

    Editor -> System : confirms data

    activate System

        System --> Editor : creates the map and displays operation success
    deactivate System


@enduml